<title>USA: Amerada Hess Corp Q1 net dropped.</title>
<headline>Amerada Hess Corp Q1 net dropped.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.05		    $0.71</p>
<p> Net			  4,600		   66,000</p>
<p> Revs		   2,416,100		2,232,500</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  93,000		   93,000</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: First Call Q1 consensus was $0.03.</p>
<p>Net includes after tax exploration and production profits of $96.6 million vs $68.0 million and refining, marketing and shipping loss $56 million vs profit $44 million.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
